OL,3,AUkrainian guilty of vandalism at
OL,4,Amosques linked to Russian network
OL,5,Abehind Starmer arson attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Ukrainian man has pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Fspraying abusive graffiti on mosques in
OL,9,Feast London, in a case linked to the
OL,10,FRussian state network behind arson
OL,11,Fattacks against the former prime
OL,12,Fminister Sir Keir Starmer.
OL,14,FIllia Bilyk, 21, entered guilty pleas
OL,15,Fat Thames Magistrates' Court to five
OL,16,Fcounts of racially and religiously
OL,17,Faggravated criminal damage.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
