OL,3,AUkrainian guilty of vandalism at
OL,4,Amosques linked to Russian network
OL,5,Abehind Starmer arson attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FBilyk sprayed graffiti on the Stratford
OL,8,FIslamic Association, Al-Birr Mosque and
OL,9,FLeyton Jamia Masjid on 23 January 2025.
OL,10,FTwo days later he targeted Noor Ul
OL,11,FIslam Primary School and the Islamic
OL,12,FShariah Council.
OL,14,FThe BBC has learned that Bilyk told
OL,15,Fpolice he was recruited into spraying
OL,16,Fthe graffiti by a Russian speaker after
OL,17,Fbeing approached on the messaging app
OL,18,FTelegram.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
